==Battleground==
*1 [[Squid (Enemy)|Squid]] spawns.
*3 [[Squid (Enemy)|Squid]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squid (Enemy)|Squid]] spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Young Man Mola (Enemy)|Young Man Mola]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Squid (Enemy)|Squid]] spawn, delay 8.33 seconds<sup>250f</sup>.
**5 [[Sardine (Enemy)|Sardines]] spawn, delay 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

